UM to $2 billion. 10 years building security and compliance for regulated fintechs. 4.5 years running Konfirmity profitably.</p><a class="mt-8 inline-block border border-white bg-white px-6 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium uppercase leading-5 tracking-wider text-[#181818] transition-colors duration-250 hover:bg-transparent hover:text-white hover:border-white" href="/contact-us">Book a call</a></div></div></section><div class="border-y border-[#a7a7a7]"><div class="container-konfirmity mx-auto border-x border-[#a7a7a7] h-[120px]"></div></div></main><footer class="relative bg-[#f3f3ee] border-b border-[#a7a7a7] px-[30px] pb-12"><div class="container-konfirmity"><div class="h-px w-full bg-[#a7a7a7] mb-8"></div><div class="mb-16"><a aria-label="Konfirmity home" class="mb-6 inline-block" href="/"><img alt="Konfirmity" loading="lazy" width="160" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/Group-1686557233.svg"/></a><p class="w-full max-w-[620px] font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] mb-6">Security-driven compliance platform built by operators with deep experience scaling regulated fintech infrastructure. Founded by the CTO who built NIUM.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><img alt="ISO 27001 certified" loading="lazy" width="72" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/ISO27001.svg"/><img alt="SOC 2 Type II audit in progress" loading="lazy" width="72" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/soc2.svg"/></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-[auto_auto_1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]"><div><div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-[#f43e01]"></span><span class="font-[family-name:var(--font-geist-mono)] text-sm font-semibold uppercase leading-4 tracking-[1px] text-[#f43e01]">PLATFORM</span></div><nav class="flex flex-col gap-3"><a class="font-[family-name:va