Matter for Companies Selling to Enterprise Clients\"},{\"id\":\"sample-structure-of-a-roles-responsibilities-matrix\",\"text\":\"Sample Structure of a Roles \u0026 Responsibilities Matrix\"},{\"id\":\"maintenance-reviewing-updating-and-auditing-roles-responsibilities\",\"text\":\"Maintenance: Reviewing, Updating and Auditing Roles \u0026 Responsibilities\"},{\"id\":\"conclusion\",\"text\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"id\":\"faqs\",\"text\":\"FAQs\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 bg-[#f43e01] px-5 py-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-geist-mono font-medium text-white uppercase text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":\"Request a Demo\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-sm leading-snug text-white/90 mb-5\",\"children\":\"See how Konfirmity turns real security into continuous compliance.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"source\":\"article_sidebar\",\"href\":\"/contact-us\",\"className\":\"block w-full text-center bg-white text-[#181818] px-4 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors duration-250 hover:bg-[#181818] hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Book a Demo\"}]]}],false,[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-lg max-w-none w-full lg:w-[70%] min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"ISO 27001 is an international standard that defines how organisations establish, implement, operate and continually improve an \",[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/glossary/isms-definition\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"information security management system (ISMS)\"}],\". The standard’s power comes from its focus on governance. Annex A control 5.2 requires organisations to \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"define and allocate roles and responsibilities for information security\"}],\". Having a clear structure ensures that every asset and process is owned by someone and that staff know what they must do. When companies sell to enterprises, this clarity instils confidence that the vendor can handle confidential data and meet contractual obligations.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"Clear role allocation is not just about passing an audit. It strengthens the ISMS by clarifying who approves policies, who manages risk, who operates technical controls and who audits the system. It aids compliance because requirements under clauses 4–10 of ISO 27001 depend on assigned accountability. It also builds trust with clients because buyers see that the vendor has people responsible for protecting data. In the following sections we will cover the standard’s structure, the purpose of Annex A 5.2, concepts like accountability and documentation, typical roles and their responsibilities, a step‑by‑step guide to setting up roles, how roles tie into broader ISO 27001 requirements, common pitfalls, why this matters for enterprise sellers and how to maintain your roles matrix over time.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L3b\",\"\\n\",\"$L3c\",\"\\n\",\"$L3d\",\"\\n\",\"$L3e\",\"\\n\",\"$L3f\",\"\\n\",\"$L40\",\"\\n\",\"$L41\",\"\\n\",\"$L42\",\"\\n\",\"$L43\",\"\\n\",\"$L44\",\"\\n\",\"$L45\",\"\\n\",\"$L46\",\"\\n\",\"$L47\",\"\\n\",\"$L48\",\"\\n\",\"$L49\",\"\\n\",\"$L4a\",\"\\n\",\"$L4b\",\"\\n\",\"$L4c\",\"\\n\",\"$L4d\",\"\\n\",\"$L4e\",\"\\n\",\"$L4f\",\"\\n\",\"$L50\",\"\\n\",\"$L51\",\"\\n\",\"$L52\",\"\\n\",\"$L53\",\"\\n\",\"$L54\",\"\\n\",\"$L55\",\"\\n\",\"$L56\",\"\\n\",\"$L57\",\"\\n\",\"$L58\",\"\\n\",\"$L59\",\"\\n\",\"$L5a\",\"\\n\",\"$L5b\",\"\\n\",\"$L5c\",\"\\n\",\"$L5d\",\"\\n\",\"$L5e\",\"\\n\",\"$L5f\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"32:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-[#a7a7a7]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#f3f3ee]\",\"children\":