xt-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"CASCADES Model\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"Features Overview\",{\"href\":\"/features-and-capabilities\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"Features Overview\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"Vendor Management\",{\"href\":\"/features/vendor-management\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"Vendor Management\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"People Management\",{\"href\":\"/features/people-management\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"People Management\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"Vulnerability Management\",{\"href\":\"/features/vulnerability-management\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"Vulnerability Management\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"Risk Assessments\",{\"href\":\"/features/risk-assessments\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"Risk Assessments\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"Framework Implementation\",{\"href\":\"/features/framework-implementation\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"Framework Implementation\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"Integrations\",{\"href\":\"/integrations\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"Integrations\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"On-Demand Demo\",{\"href\":\"/product-demo\",\"className\":\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mona-sans)] text-base leading-6 text-[#535862] no-underline transition-colors hover:text-[#f43e01]\",\"children\":\"On-Demand Demo\"}],\"$L64\",\"$L65\",\"$L66\"]}]]}],\"$L67\",\"$L68\",\"$L69\",\"$L6a\",\"$L6b\"]}],\"$L6c\",\"$L6d\"]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"38:[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"76:I[64822,[\"/_next/static/chunks/38hve50aoh2nq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3q_n5t60w5w9k.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1jtlvgg8y728n.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/39dsg7ug41wpj.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0pw3e8ftort5l.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3o270br-klsk-.js\"],\"NativeLeadForm\"]\n7b:I[4396,[\"/_next/static/chunks/38hve50aoh2nq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3q_n5t60w5w9k.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1jtlvgg8y728n.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/39dsg7ug41wpj.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0pw3e8ftort5l.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3o270br-klsk-.js\"],\"FaqAccordion\"]\n7c:I[4396,[\"/_next/static/chunks/38hve50aoh2nq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3q_n5t60w5w9k.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1jtlvgg8y728n.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/39dsg7ug41wpj.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0pw3e8ftort5l.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3o270br-klsk-.js\"],\"FaqItem\"]\n3b:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"what-iso-27001-says-about-roles-responsibilities\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"What ISO 27001 Says About Roles \u0026 Responsibilities\"}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"ISO 27001:2022 consists of high‑level clauses (4 through 10) and a catalogue of detailed controls in Annex A. Clause 5.3 requires top management to assign and communicate responsibilities relevant to the ISMS. Annex A controls supplement the clauses; control 5.2 covers roles and responsibilities.\"}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"purpose-of-annex-a-5-2\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[22px] md:text-[24px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-8 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Purpose of Annex A 5.2\"}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Annex A 5.2’s purpose is to \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"establish a defined, approved and understood structure for implementing, operating and managing information security\"}],\". The control ensures that each information asset has a designated owner responsible for its protection. Organisations are expected to create a formal structure assigning responsibilities to all employees. The control recognises that smaller organisations may assign multiple responsibilities to a single person, while larger ones might create dedicated teams. Auditors look for evidence that responsibilities are documented and proportionate to the organisation’s size.\"]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"key-concepts-roles-responsibilities-accountability-and-documentation\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[22px] md:text-[24px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-8 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Key Concepts: Roles, Responsibilities, Accountability and Documentation\"}]\n40:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"A \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"role\"}],\" refers to a job function or position. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Responsibilities\"}],\" define what actions the role must perform and what decisions it can take. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Accountability\"}],\" means that a person or function is answerable for the outcome. ISO 27001 expects organisations to avoid vague job descriptions; responsibilities must be clearly documented and communicated. This can be done via employment agreements, internal security policies, procedures or a central responsibility matrix or organisational chart. Documentation should show who is responsible, who approves, who is consulted and who is informed for each control. Smaller organisations may assign multiple roles to one person but must manage conflicts of interest and ensure segregation of duties. Larger organisations often employ dedicated security managers or compliance officers.\"]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"typical-roles-and-who-should-own-what\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[22px] md:text-[24px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-8 mb-3\",\"children\":"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\"Typical Roles and Who Should Own What\"}]\n42:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"ISO 27001 does not prescribe job titles, so companies may adapt the structure to fit their context. The following table summarises common roles and responsibilities relevant for enterprises. (The term \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"ISO 27001 Roles And Responsibilities\"}],\" appears in the first column but is not repeated; the matrix is an example.)\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"43:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 w-full overflow-x-auto border border-[#a7a7a7]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-collapse font-mona text-sm text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b-2 border-b-[#F43E01]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Role / Function\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Responsibilities \u0026 accountabilities\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Authorization level\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Assets / processes owned\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Notes\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"className\":\"[\u0026\u003etr:nth-child(even)]:bg-[#FAFAF7] [\u0026\u003etr:nth-child(odd)]:bg-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Top management / executives\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Approve ISMS policies; set security objectives; allocate resources; ensure leadership commitment; review ISMS performance\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"High-level; authority to approve policies and budgets\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Strategic direction; policy oversight\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Must demonstrate commitment during audits; typically chairs management review meetings\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Information Security Manager / CISO\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Oversee ISMS implementation; manage risk assessments; coordinate control implementation; monitor compliance; liaise with auditors\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Authority to enforce security controls across departments\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"ISMS scope; risk register; policies; incident response plan\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"In smaller firms this role may be an additional duty of the CTO or operations director\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Asset / system owners\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Protect assigned information assets; classify data; ensure access control; approve user permissions; ensure maintenance and backups\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Authority over assigned systems\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Specific applications, databases, servers, documents\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Asset owners must ensure controls operate effectively and report issues\"}]]}],\"$L6e\",\"$L6f\",\"$L70\",\"$L71\"]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"44:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"Depending on company size, one person may hold multiple roles. However, separation of duties is essential to reduce conflicts; for instance, the person deploying software should not be the one who approves its deployment.\"}]\n45:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"how-to-set-up-roles-responsibilities-step-by-step\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"How to Set Up Roles \u0026 Responsibilities (Step‑by‑Step)\"}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"className\":\"w-full h-auto my-6 rounded\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":576,\"src\":\"/images/blog/iso-27001-roles-and-responsibilities/how-to-set-up-roles-and-responsibilities.webp\",\"alt\":\"How to Set Up Roles \u0026 Responsibilities (Step‑by‑Step)\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"47:[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4 list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Understand organisational context and stakeholder needs.\"}],\" ISO 27001 Clause 4.2 requires organisations to identify interested parties (customers, regulators, partners, internal departments) and their security requirements. For enterprise sellers, this includes procurement teams, regulatory authorities and customers with strict security addenda.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Define the scope of your ISMS.\"}],\" Clause 4.3 mandates defining the ISMS scope. Focus on assets, processes and resources that handle enterprise client data. This will determine which roles are critical. Use an inventory to list assets and assign an owner.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"List required roles and responsibilities.\"}],\" Create a responsibility matrix (e.g., RACI: Responsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed). This matrix should identify job functions and map them to ISO 27001 Roles And Responsibilities. Include top management, ISMS manager, asset owners, department heads, system administrators, auditors and employees.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Map responsibilities to people or job functions.\"}],\" Compare your matrix with existing job descriptions. For roles not currently covered, assign responsibilities to specific employees or create new positions. Ensure there is adequate segregation; avoid assigning conflicting duties to the same person.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Document the assignments.\"}],\" Document responsibilities in employment agreements, internal policies, procedures and the ISMS documentation. Annex A 5.2 emphasises that roles must be documented, communicated and applied consistently across the organisation. Use a central system where the responsibility matrix can be maintained and referenced.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Communicate internally.\"}],\" Share the matrix and related policies with staff. Present the responsibilities during onboarding and security awareness sessions. This builds an organisational mindset oriented toward security and ensures everyone knows what is expected of them.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L72\",\"\\n\",\"$L73\",\"\\n\",\"$L74\",\"\\n\",\"$L75\",\"\\n\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"48:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"By following these steps, companies ensure that ISO 27001 Roles And Responsibilities are not just documented but integrated into operations.\"}]\n49:[\"$\",\"$L76\",null,{\"formId\":\"iso-27001-roles-and-responsibilities-lead-form\",\"title\":\"Clear ownership turns ISO 27001 documentation into working security.\",\"description\":\"Share your work email and we'll review how your roles map to real ISMS accountability.\"}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"how-roles-responsibilities-tie-into-broader-iso-27001-requirements\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"How Roles \u0026 Responsibilities Tie Into Broader ISO 27001 Requirements\"}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Defined roles underpin the entire ISMS. They support the \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"confidentiality, integrity and availability\"}],\" triad by clarifying who implements controls, who approves risk treatments and who monitors results. Here are several linkages:\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4c:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Governance and leadership.\"}],\" Top management’s commitment is essential. Clause 5.2 requires management to establish an information security policy, allocate resources and ensure communication. Without clear roles, governance falls apart.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Risk management.\"}],\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.urmconsulting.com/blog/iso-27001-2022-a-5-organisational-controls-information-security-management\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"Clause 6.1\"}],\" requires organisations to identify, evaluate and treat risks. Assigning responsibilities ensures someone performs risk assessments, approves treatment plans and verifies that treatments are effective.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Security policies and documentation.\"}],\" Clause 5.2 emphasises that policies must be approved and communicated. Roles define who writes, reviews and approves each policy and who ensures that documents are current.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Security controls and authorisation levels.\"}],\" Annex A controls cover asset management, access control, cryptography, operations security, physical security, supplier relationships, incident management, business continuity and compliance. Each control requires an owner. For example, the asset management control (Annex A 5.9) assigns responsibility for maintaining an inventory and classifying assets; access control controls assign responsibility for granting permissions; incident response controls assign roles for detection and reporting.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Incident response and internal audit.\"}],\" In the event of a breach, clear roles enable a structured response. The \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.aryaka.com/blog/ibm-2025-cost-of-a-data-breach-how-ai-and-shadow-ai-shape-cybersecurity/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"IBM report\"}],\" emphasises that quick detection and containment reduce costs. Companies must designate incident managers, technical responders and communicators. Internal audit roles are separate from operations to avoid conflicts, as recommended by the segregation of duties control.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"$L77\",\" Clause 10 calls for corrective actions and continual improvement. Assigning responsibilities ensures that corrective actions are owned and tracked. Roles also support compliance with other frameworks (SOC 2, HIPAA, GDPR) because mapping cross‑framework controls requires someone to manage alignment.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4d:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"common-challenges-pitfalls\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Common Challenges \u0026 Pitfalls\"}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"Implementing ISO 27001 Roles And Responsibilities is not trivial. Companies often encounter issues such as:\"}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"sizes\":\"100vw\",\"className\":\"w-full h-auto my-6 rounded\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":576,\"src\":\"/images/blog/iso-27001-roles-and-responsibilities/common-challenges-and-pitfalls.webp\",\"alt\":\"Common Challenges \u0026 Pitfalls\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"50:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Lack of clear documentation.\"}],\" If responsibilities are not documented or communicated, staff may assume someone else is responsible, leading to gaps. Auditors look for evidence of assigned responsibilities.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Too many responsibilities on one person.\"}],\" In small organisations, one person may take multiple roles. Without careful segregation, this can create conflicts (e.g., the person managing the ISMS also auditing it). Use compensating controls such as peer reviews and audit trails.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Insufficient training.\"}],\" Staff may not understand what the policies require, leading to non‑conformance. Training should be mandatory and role‑specific.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Outdated documentation.\"}],\" As companies grow or change technology, the responsibility matrix must be updated. Outdated matrices result in unassigned assets and unmonitored controls. Use periodic management reviews to keep documentation current.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Misalignment between documented responsibilities and technical controls.\"}],\" Assigning an asset owner without ensuring they have the authority to manage permissions defeats the purpose. Access rights must reflect the documented responsibilities.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"51:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"why-roles-responsibilities-matter-for-companies-selling-to-enterprise-clients\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Why Roles \u0026 Responsibilities Matter for Companies Selling to Enterprise Clients\"}]\n52:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Enterprise clients subject vendors to rigorous due‑diligence. They ask for organisational charts, roles matrices and evidence that security controls are operational. Having \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"ISO 27001 Roles And Responsibilities\"}],\" clearly defined positions your company as trustworthy and reduces sales friction. There are several reasons:\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"53:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Proof for audits and vendor assessments.\"}],\" Auditors and customers want documented responsibilities. \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.urmconsulting.com/blog/iso-27001-2022-a-5-organisational-controls-information-security-management\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"URM Consulting\"}],\" advises documenting roles in job descriptions, contracts and policies. A matrix shows that there is accountability for each control.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Reduced risk and faster incident response.\"}],\" The Morgan Lewis analysis of the 2024 cost‑of‑breach report found that breaches lasting more than \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.morganlewis.com/blogs/sourcingatmorganlewis/2025/05/study-finds-average-cost-of-data-breaches-significantly-increased-globally-in-2024\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"200 days cost \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"USD 5.46 million\"}]]}],\", while breaches contained in less than 200 days cost \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"USD 4.07 million\"}],\". Clear roles lead to faster detection and containment, saving money.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Operational efficiency.\"}],\" Konfirmity’s delivery experience across more than \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"6,000 security audits\"}],\" shows that companies that implement structured evidence collection and clear ownership reduce audit preparation time by \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.konfirmity.com/blog/iso-27001-evidence-collection-templates\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"75 percent\"}],\" and achieve SOC 2 readiness in \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"4–5 months\"}],\" compared with \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"9–12 months\"}]]}],\" for self‑managed programmes. They spend under \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"70\"}],\" hours per year** on evidence tasks, versus \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"550–600 hours\"}],\" without a managed service. This efficiency appeals to enterprise buyers who want to see sustained compliance.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Trust and transparency.\"}],\" Enterprise buyers often share sensitive data such as personal information, financial records or healthcare information. They need assurance that someone owns the systems and processes that protect their data. A responsibility matrix provides that transparency.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L78\",\"\\n\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"54:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"sample-structure-of-a-roles-responsibilities-matrix\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Sample Structure of a Roles \u0026 Responsibilities Matrix\"}]\n55:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"An effective matrix is usually a spreadsheet or table that maps roles to responsibilities, authorisation levels and assets. Here is a simplified example:\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"56:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-6 w-full overflow-x-auto border border-[#a7a7a7]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-collapse font-mona text-sm text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b-2 border-b-[#F43E01]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Role / Function\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Responsibilities\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Authorisation level\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Assets / Processes Owned\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] bg-[#FDE6CE] px-3 py-2.5 text-left align-top font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Comments\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"className\":\"[\u0026\u003etr:nth-child(even)]:bg-[#FAFAF7] [\u0026\u003etr:nth-child(odd)]:bg-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Information Security Manager\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Overall responsibility for the ISMS; oversees risk management; enforces policy; coordinates audits and incident response\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Access to all systems within scope\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"ISMS documentation; risk register; incident response plan\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Reports to executive leadership; may also serve as DPO in small firms\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Asset Owner (e.g., CRM system)\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Classifies data; ensures backups and encryption; reviews access rights regularly; coordinates with system administrators on updates\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Authority to approve or reject user access; can request changes to configuration\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Specific application (CRM); related databases\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Must document data flows and classification; ensures vendor contracts include security clauses\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Internal Auditor\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Plans and executes internal audits; checks compliance with policies and controls; reports findings to leadership; follows up on remediation\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Independent; no access to change systems\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Audit schedule; findings log; corrective action tracker\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#e4e4dd] px-3 py-2 align-top leading-[150%]\",\"children\":\"Should not audit processes they manage; rotation of auditors recommended\"}]]}],\"$L79\",\"$L7a\"]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"57:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"You can adapt this structure to your organisation and expand columns to include consulted and informed parties (RACI). The important part is that every control has a person responsible and someone accountable.\"}]\n58:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"maintenance-reviewing-updating-and-auditing-roles-responsibilities\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Maintenance: Reviewing, Updating and Auditing Roles \u0026 Responsibilities\"}]\n59:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"An up‑to‑date responsibility matrix is a living document. To keep it effective:\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5a:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Review periodically.\"}],\" Conduct an annual review or whenever there is a significant change in organisation structure, business processes or technology. Review responsibilities as part of the management review meeting.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Audit adherence.\"}],\" Internal audits should verify that responsibilities are followed. Auditors examine job descriptions, policies and evidence to confirm that staff perform their assigned duties.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Update documentation.\"}],\" When personnel change roles, update the matrix, policies and access rights. Document changes with version histories to show traceability.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Communicate changes and retrain.\"}],\" Inform employees of role changes and provide additional training where necessary. For example, when a department head becomes the asset owner for a new system, ensure they know how to manage access and classify data.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"Log changes and decisions.\"}],\" Keep a change log. This helps auditors see that the organisation manages its ISMS proactively and supports continual improvement.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose my-10 border border-[#a7a7a7] bg-[#e8e8db]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 p-8 md:p-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0 mb-3 font-jakarta text-[24px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-konfirmity-black md:text-[30px]\",\"children\":\"Give every ISMS responsibility a named, accountable owner\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-7 font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-konfirmity-body\",\"children\":\"Book a demo and we'll show how Konfirmity keeps your responsibility matrix current as people change roles, so policy approvals and control ownership never quietly lapse.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"href\":\"/book-a-demo\",\"source\":\"blog_body_cta\",\"className\":\"inline-block bg-[#181818] px-7 py-3 font-mona text-sm font-medium uppercase leading-5 text-white no-underline transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#F43E01]\",\"children\":\"Book a demo\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-[240px] w-full shrink-0 md:h-[260px] md:w-[42%]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/blocks/demo-cta.webp\",\"alt\":\"\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-contain p-2\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 42vw\"}]}]]}]}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"conclusion\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Conclusion\"}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Implementing \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"ISO 27001 Roles And Responsibilities\"}],\" is foundational for strong security, effective risk management and credibility with enterprise clients. By clearly defining who owns what, documenting responsibilities, providing training and periodically auditing compliance, organisations transform the standard from a document into an operational practice. In a market where \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.morganlewis.com/blogs/sourcingatmorganlewis/2025/05/study-finds-average-cost-of-data-breaches-significantly-increased-globally-in-2024\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":[\"data breach costs exceed \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-[#181818]\",\"children\":\"USD 4 million\"}]]}],\" and regulated buyers demand evidence, mere policies are not enough. Companies that start with security and treat compliance as an outcome save time, reduce risk and close deals faster. A human‑led managed service like Konfirmity’s ensures that responsibilities are implemented inside your stack, monitored continuously and ready for audits year‑round—turning security into a trusted business enabler.\"]}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"faqs\",\"className\":\"font-jakarta text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-[130%] text-[#181818] mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"FAQs\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5f:[\"$\",\"$L7b\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7c\",null,{\"question\":\"What is the role and responsibilities matrix in ISO 27001?\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[\"A role and responsibilities matrix is a table or spreadsheet that maps job functions to specific information security duties and levels of authority. It clarifies who is responsible (does the work), who is accountable (owns the outcome), who is consulted and who is informed for each control. \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://hightable.io/iso-27001-annex-a-5-2-information-security-roles-and-responsibilities/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"Annex A 5.2\"}],\" requires roles and responsibilities to be defined and allocated according to the organisation’s needs.\"]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L7c\",null,{\"question\":\"What are the responsibilities of ISO 27001 management?\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"Top management must commit to and approve the ISMS, define the security policy, provide resources, set objectives, support risk management and ensure communication across the organisation. They must also review ISMS performance and direct corrective actions.\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$L7c\",null,{\"question\":\"What is the ISO clause for roles and responsibilities?\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://hightable.io/iso-27001-annex-a-5-2-information-security-roles-and-responsibilities/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"Annex A 5.2\"}],\", titled \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Information Security Roles and Responsibilities\"}],\", requires organisations to define and allocate information security roles. Clause 5.3 in the main body of ISO 27001 also requires management to assign and communicate responsibilities and authorities.\"]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L7c\",null,{\"question\":\"What are the six central security areas under ISO 27001?\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mona text-base leading-[170%] text-[#535862] mb-4\",\"children\":\"While ISO 27001 includes many controls, six broad areas relevant to roles and responsibilities are: (1) organisational governance and leadership (policies, management commitment); (2) asset management (inventory, classification and ownership); (3) access and identity management (authentication, authorisation and reviews); (4) human resource security (training, screening, termination procedures); (5) technical controls (system configuration, encryption, network security, vulnerability management); and (6) incident response and compliance (detection, reporting, internal audit, corrective actions). Having defined roles ensures that each area is managed effectively.\"}]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"60:[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"iso-27001-change-management\",{\"href\":\"/blog/iso-27001-change-management\",\"className\":\"block group\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/blog/iso-27001-change-management/iso-27001.webp\",\"loading\":\"lazy\",\"alt\":\"ISO 27001 Change Management: A Walkthrough with Templates (2026)\",\"width\":564,\"height\":300,\"className\":\"w-full h-auto\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-[#a7a7a7] relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-[40px] bg-[url('/images/8px-Flip_3.svg')] bg-[position:0_0] bg-auto\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 bg-[#181818] px-4 py-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#fffbfb] uppercase mb-0 font-geist-mono text-base leading-6\",\"children\":\"Beginner Guides\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#f43e01] uppercase mb-0 font-geist-mono text-sm\",\"children\":\"amit-gupta\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#f43e01] rounded-full w-[6px] h-[6px]\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#f43e01] uppercase mb-0 font-geist-mono text-sm\",\"children\":\"2026-02-27\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-between items-start mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#181d27] mb-0 font-jakarta tex